{"base":"ee347caed147d8ee5b63be813cbb31a3ada1a414","description":"- add `create [<revision>]` to open a release COB up front, so a script\n  can create once and register many artifacts with `--release <id>`\n- reuse your own release idempotently for the same commit and tag; treat\n  a different tag on the same commit as a distinct release and mint it\n  without prompting\n- print the release id on stdout (`--json` for `{release_id, oid}`)\n\nEnables the create-once/register-many flow for release scripts, replacing\nreliance on `register`'s lazy, prompt-driven release creation.","oid":"220c7a412f1dff7b1dc9ead3ae86efb7bb03408d","type":"revision"}